      "response": {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "I'm the **Vite AI Copilot** — a rule-based assistant (no external AI), answering from the CRM's own documented rules.\nI can:\n**Explain a computation** — ask *\"how is my conversion rate computed?\"* and I'll give you the formula, its numerator and denominator, and why it's defined that way\n**Explain the business rules** — lead scoring signals, the frozen status model, assignment, calling outcomes, outreach, Won vs Lost, permissions\n**Diagnose a number** — *\"why did my lead score change?\"*, *\"why is this lead unassigned?\"*, *\"why can't I access Reports?\"*\n**Walk you through workflows** — qualifying a prospect, working a lead, follow-ups, closing\n**Navigate** — Dashboard, Leads, Outreach, Planner, Reports, Activity Logs, My Performance\n\nIf the CRM doesn't define something, I'll say so rather than guess. What I can't do yet is quote *your* live figures.\nTap a suggested prompt or just ask."
      }
